    {
      "itemId": "sat:item:pdf-d3c7a34699d047ea8060775dea4d6b63-m2-q20",
      "itemRevision": 1,
      "answer": {
        "status": "needs-review",
        "type": "single-choice",
        "optionId": "choice-d"
      },
      "explanation": {
        "status": "needs-review",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "markdown",
            "text": "四个选项的二次项都是$3x^2$，因为一个因式为$x+2b$, 设另一个因式为$3x+k$。将两个因式相\n乘展开得到$(x+2b)(3x+k)=3x^2+(k+6b)x+2bk$。因为四个选项的常数项都是$18b$，所以\n$2bk=18b$，解出$k=9$。\n因此$x$ 项的系数$k+6b=9+6b$。选项A：$9+6b=9$，解出$b=0$，不是正整数。选项$B$：\n$9+6b=30$，解出$b=3.5$，不是整数。选项$C$：$9+6b=42$，解出$b=5.5$，不是整数。选项$D$：\n$9+6b=51$，解出$b=7$。选$D$"
          }
        ]
      },
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "pdf-source-standard-answer",
        "sourceSetId": "pdf-d3c7a34699d047ea8060775dea4d6b63",
        "sourceQuestionId": "m2-q20"
      }
